#                        main.rs at Ch.1; restore from `main` branch or pre-
#                        1.6.a history when wiring work resumes.
#   - src/inbound/spr_engine.rs : SPR-compressed conversation context — also
#                        never wired; Phase-2 target for CommandAction::Inference
#                        prompt assembly.
src/api/
src/inbound/spr_engine.rs
.claude/
*.bak
CLAUDE.md.bak
